# Cadence - Root Environment Template
# Copy to `.env` at the repo root if you want shell-level access, but the canonical
# location is `main/.env` (loaded automatically by `revive.config.load_config`).
# This file exists so a new contributor knows what to expect at the root.

# All keys are optional. Cadence runs fully offline with zero keys. The only
# setting you must have a sane value for is:
RZP_WEBHOOK_SECRET=revive_dev_webhook_secret

# See `main/.env.example` for the full list with comments.
